{"context":"Execution state today in .eka/execution-state.md is git-ignored, not canonical, not synced across devices. Need proper CKO so eka status can show current state deterministically. Must respect immutability, strata Execution, transport semantics (ADR-010/032). Related ADR-009/011/012, ADR-036. Validated via Gate 4 self-review PASS + user confirmation.","decision":"Define execution-state snapshot as ses- CKO (Execution, stratum 4) with keys: scope (ctr ref), items, current, next, decisions, mode. Each update = new instanceVersion. Storage repo-attributed via snapshot push for cross-device sync; workspace-native only via --adopt. Status repo-scoped reads latest ses and renders current only; history via eka get ses:\u003cid\u003e --timeline. Migration: convert .eka/execution-state.md into ses:execution-state:1 then retire markdown.","consequences":"Positive: immutable, queryable, syncable via push. Negative: migration needed. Neutral: status shows latest only.","alternativesConsidered":"A) New token rejected closed set; B) ctr workItems prose rejected; C) ses snapshot chosen; D) run- wrong stratum; E) keep markdown rejected.","status":"accepted"}